    "blurb": "Audit-proof archiving for processes",
    "overview": "Connect Camunda-based business processes to a yuuvis® Momentum archive to ensure legally compliant document storage while significantly streamlining and accelerating processes.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Secure, scalable archiving, seamlessly integrated into Camunda processes",
    "splashDescription": "The yuuvis® Momentum Archiving connector enhances Camunda-based business processes with a powerful, direct, and audit-proof archiving function without middleware, complex integration, or manual steps. Seamlessly connecting to a yuuvis® Momentum archive ensures legally compliant document storage while significantly streamlining and accelerating business processes. Documents are archived automatically during process execution, metadata is transferred in a structured manner, and the entire operation is completed without media disruptions. The connector delivers faster throughput thanks to in-process automated archiving and reduces manual steps and interfaces. It's ready to use with an example process and documented configuration. This connector is ideal for organizations that want to integrate audit-proof archiving seamlessly into their Camunda processes efficiently, compliantly, and future-ready.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/555764/overview/img11623789592054211170.png?8997614e904f8684da97af7b7b397694",
